<title>USA: NYMEX cuts margins on COMEX copper futures.</title>
<headline>NYMEX cuts margins on COMEX copper futures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>NYMEX said margins on its COMEX division's high grade copper futures contracts will be lowered at the close of business Monday.</p>
<p>The margins will be decreased to $1,600 from $2,100 for clearing members, members and hedgers, and to $2,160 from $2,835 for speculators.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
